{"node":{"id":"MONDO:0008310","label":"Hutchinson-Gilford progeria syndrome","definition":"Hutchinson-Gilford progeria syndrome is a rare, fatal, autosomal dominant and premature aging disease, beginning in childhood and characterized by growth reduction, failure to thrive, a typical facial appearance (prominent forehead, protuberant eyes, thin nose with a beaked tip, thin lips, micrognathia and protruding ears) and distinct dermatologic features (generalized alopecia, aged-looking skin, sclerotic and dimpled skin over the abdomen and extremities, prominent cutaneous vasculature, dyspigmentation, nail hypoplasia and loss of subcutaneous fat).","synonyms":["HGPS","Hutchinson Gilford progeria syndrome","Hutchinson-Gilford disease","Hutchinson-Gilford progeria","premature senility syndrome","progeria"],"xrefs":["DOID:3911","GARD:0007467","ICD9:259.8","MEDGEN:46123","MedDRA:10036794","NANDO:1201007","NANDO:2200833","NCIT:C34951","OMIM:176670","Orphanet:740","SCTID:238870004","UMLS:C0033300"],"parents":[],"parents_labels":{},"children":[],"children_labels":{},"in_core":false,"cluster_id":null,"is_group":false,"n_genes":2,"n_phenotypes":102,"mechanism_classes":[]},"genes":[{"id":"e_6cb98d290595","source":"MONDO:0008310","target":"LMNA","type":"caused_by","evidence":[{"db":"Orphanet","origin":"Orphanet","record":"ORPHA:740","level":"curated","date":"2026-06-23","url":"https://www.orpha.net/en/disease/detail/740","confidence":0.95,"snippet":"Disease-causing germline mutation(s) in (Assessed) — lamin A/C"},{"db":"HPO","origin":"Orphanet","record":"ORPHA:740","level":"curated","date":"2026-09-02","confidence":0.9,"url":"https://hpo.jax.org/browse/disease/ORPHA:740","snippet":"LMNA is annotated as disease gene of ORPHA:740 (HPO genes_to_phenotype, Orphanet-derived)"}],"contradicting":[],"confidence":0.95,"independent_sources":["Orphanet"],"level":"curated"},{"id":"e_29550202a174","source":"MONDO:0008310","target":"ZMPSTE24","type":"caused_by","evidence":[{"db":"Orphanet","orig